ent-title1 g-redish hero-bannerr\">About Aman Yadav, and The Tech Skills Stack.<a href=\"https://github.com/amanyadav-work\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"github-profile\"> GitHub <svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" color=\"red\" style=\"color:red\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M6 6v2h8.59L5 17.59 6.41 19 16 9.41V18h2V6z\"></path></svg></a></h1><p class=\"hero-text gradient-title1 g-redish opacity-75\">I’m 21, based in Mumbai, India. passionate about building impactful web applications and exploring new technologies. Beyond coding, I occasionally tinker with Docker, experiment with VPNs and proxies, and explore OS-level curiosities—small ways I keep learning and challenging myself.</p><div class=\"d-flex boxs text-light mt-3\"><ul class=\"list-group w-75\"><li class=\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center text-light aboutli edu-li\">HSC 12th Science<span class=\"badge text-bg-danger rounded-pill\">2022</span></li><li class=\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center text-light edu-li\">BCA<span class=\"badge text-bg-danger rounded-pill\">2026</span></li></ul><a href=\"/resume\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"w-25 d-flex justify-content-center flex-column align-items-center edu-li\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"icon-blur h1\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M5 20h14v-2H5zM19 9h-4V3H9v6H5l7 7z\"></path></svg>CV</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"p-relative\" id=\"section-3\" data-scroll-snap=\"true\"><div class=\"hero p-sticky\" id=\"section3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(-100px)\"><div class=\"hero-container left-side\"><div class=\"hero-content\"><p class=\"hero-text\" style=\"color:#9595fc70\">A brief snapshot of my journey...</p><h1 class=\"hero-heading gradient-title1 g-blue\">Building Scalable &amp; Driven Applications. <br/><a href=\"https://www.behance.net/aman-yadav\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Behance Profile Link\">Behance <svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" color=\"blue\" style=\"color:blue\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M6 6v2h8.59L5 17.59 6.41 19 16 9.41V18h2V6z\"></path></svg></a></h1><p class=\"hero-text gradient-title1 g-blue opacity-100\">Have shipped end-to-end applications, working on frontend interfaces, backend services, third-party integrations, and UI/UX design to deliver complete, production-ready solutions.</p><div class=\"parabox-list\"><div class=\"accordions d-flex mt-3\"><div class=\"accordion-items\"><h3 class=\"bgactive\"><span class=\"rotation w-100\">TuringX</span></h3><p class=\"gradient-title1 g-blue\"><a aria-label=\"company-experience-link\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.turingx.in/\" class=\"exp-links\">See Website<svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" color=\"blue\" style=\"color:blue\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M6 6v2h8.59L5 17.59 6.41 19 16 9.41V18h2V6z\"></path></svg></a> <br/><br/>Worked on end-to-end data analytics applications, focusing on secure data pipelines, role-based access, and scalable frontend-backend integration using Next.js and Golang.</p></div><div class=\"accordion-items\"><h3 class=\"\"><span class=\"rotation w-100\">Innois</span></h3></div><div class=\"accordion-items\"><h3 class=\"\"><span class=\"rotation w-100\">Web Promos</span></h3></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><section id=\"section-4\"><section class=\"slider-container relative\" data-scroll-track=\"true\"><div class=\"slider\"><a href=\"https://github.com/amanyadav-work?tab=repositories\" aria-label=\"github-profile-link\" class=\"slideritem know gradient-title1 g-yellow\">See More Of Projects <svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M6 6v2h8.59L5 17.59 6.41 19 16 9.41V18h2V6z\"></path></svg></a><p class=\"top-status gradient-title1 g-yellow\">Recent Works</p><div class=\"d-flex slideritem gap-3\" style=\"transform:translateX(1%)\"><div class=\"card first-childern\" style=\"opacity:0\"><img src=\"/assets/micro-career-ai.webp\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" class=\"card-img-top position-absolute h-100 object-fit-cover\" alt=\"VR Career Engine\"/><div class=\"card-body z-3 d-flex justify-content-end flex-column\" style=\"box-shadow:inset 0px -50px 100px -27px #000000\"><h5 class=\"card-title opacity-100 gradient-title1 g-yellow\">VR Career Engine</h5><a href=\"https://career-ai-brown.vercel.app/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-container  transparent-btn \" style=\"width:100%;color:yellow;background-color:transparent\"><div class=\"original-text\"><span class=\"wavy-letter\" style=\"opacity:1\">S</span><span class=\"wavy-letter\" style=\"opacity:1\">e</span><span class=\"wavy-letter\" style=\"opacity:1\">e</span><span class=\"wavy-letter\" style=\"opacity:1\"> </span><span class=\"wavy-letter\" style=\"opacity:1\">L</span><span class=\"wavy-letter\" style=\"opacity:1\">i</span><span class=\"wavy-letter\" style=\"opacity:1\">v</span><span class=\"wavy-letter\" style=\"opacity:1\">e</span><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"margin-left:1px;margin-top:-3px\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M6 6v2h8.59L5 17.59 6.41 19 16 9.41V18h2V6z\"></path></svg></div><div class